# Leave unset for local dev (uses the Vite proxy to http://localhost:4000)
# or for a same-origin deployment where the API also serves this build.
#
# Set this when the frontend is hosted separately from the API — e.g. this
# app deployed on Vercel with the API on Railway/Render. Point it at the
# API's full public URL including the /api prefix, no trailing slash:
# VITE_API_URL="https://engecom-api-production.up.railway.app/api"
VITE_API_URL=
